  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for advancing researchers&#x2019; responsiveness to policymakers in East and West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Partnership for Economic Policy (PEP) is a southern-led global organization that is dedicated to supporting and developing capacity for locally led, gender-sensitive policy analysis in developing countries. With this grant, PEP will support research organizations in East and West Africa to translate existing evidence and data into policy actions that respond to policy challenges as they emerge. (Strategy: Evidence-Informed Policymaking)</narrative>
  </description>
